# Build-context diet (2026-07-12): the legacy builder tars + sends the whole
# tree to the daemon on EVERY build — measured 704.9MB, dominated by
# workbench-web/node_modules (410MB) which was never excluded. Nothing below
# is referenced by any COPY in Dockerfile.linux (verified by grep before each
# addition). Keep this list tight and verified — an over-eager exclude breaks
# the build loudly, a missing one just silently costs minutes per ship.
**/node_modules
# Bytecode from local runs. The image compiles its own (compileall in
# Dockerfile.linux); a local cache would carry modules that no longer exist
# and text from older source into the image.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
NOTES/
*.log
.dockerignore
Dockerfile.linux
